{
  "width": 1080,
  "height": 2250,
  "elements": [
    {"type": "text", "content": "二、一场水的四步旅行", "x": 540, "y": 90, "size": 58, "bold": true, "align": "center", "font": "title", "color": "#2B6CB0"},
    {"type": "card", "x": 80, "y": 230, "width": 560, "height": 360, "radius": 20, "border": 2},
    {"type": "text", "content": "① 蒸发：起飞", "x": 120, "y": 265, "size": 42, "bold": true, "align": "left", "max_width": 480, "font": "title", "color": "#2B6CB0"},
    {"type": "text", "content": "太阳把海面晒热，液态水变成看不见的【水汽】，随风升空。全球每年约有 50 万立方千米的水这样离开海洋——相当于 200 个太湖。", "x": 120, "y": 330, "size": 34, "align": "left", "max_width": 480},
    {"type": "asset", "file": "sun_evaporation.png", "x": 850, "y": 410, "height": 320, "rotate": 2},
    {"type": "arrow", "x": 360, "y": 610, "length": 60, "direction": "down", "width": 9, "color": "#3182CE"},
    {"type": "card", "x": 80, "y": 700, "width": 560, "height": 360, "radius": 20, "border": 2},
    {"type": "text", "content": "② 凝结：抱团", "x": 120, "y": 735, "size": 42, "bold": true, "align": "left", "max_width": 480, "font": "title", "color": "#2B6CB0"},
    {"type": "text", "content": "水汽升到高空遇冷，抱团凝成小水滴和冰晶。亿万颗聚在一起，就是我们抬头看到的【云】。", "x": 120, "y": 800, "size": 34, "align": "left", "max_width": 480},
    {"type": "asset", "file": "cloud_condensation.png", "x": 850, "y": 880, "height": 320, "rotate": -2},
    {"type": "arrow", "x": 360, "y": 1080, "length": 60, "direction": "down", "width": 9, "color": "#3182CE"},
    {"type": "card", "x": 80, "y": 1170, "width": 560, "height": 360, "radius": 20, "border": 2},
    {"type": "text", "content": "③ 降水：降落", "x": 120, "y": 1205, "size": 42, "bold": true, "align": "left", "max_width": 480, "font": "title", "color": "#2B6CB0"},
    {"type": "text", "content": "云里的水滴不断合并长大，空气托不住时集体跳伞：雨、雪、冰雹，都是它们的着陆姿势。", "x": 120, "y": 1270, "size": 34, "align": "left", "max_width": 480},
    {"type": "asset", "file": "rain_precipitation.png", "x": 850, "y": 1350, "height": 320, "rotate": 2},
    {"type": "arrow", "x": 360, "y": 1550, "length": 60, "direction": "down", "width": 9, "color": "#3182CE"},
    {"type": "card", "x": 80, "y": 1640, "width": 560, "height": 360, "radius": 20, "border": 2},
    {"type": "text", "content": "④ 径流：回家", "x": 120, "y": 1675, "size": 42, "bold": true, "align": "left", "max_width": 480, "font": "title", "color": "#2B6CB0"},
    {"type": "text", "content": "落地的水，一部分汇成河流冲回大海，一部分渗入地下慢速旅行——总之都在回家路上，回家后等下一轮出发。", "x": 120, "y": 1740, "size": 34, "align": "left", "max_width": 480},
    {"type": "asset", "file": "river_runoff.png", "x": 850, "y": 1820, "height": 320, "rotate": -2},
    {"type": "text", "content": "④ 之后回到 ①，循环永不落幕", "x": 540, "y": 2120, "size": 32, "bold": true, "align": "center", "font": "title", "color": "#7A8CA3"}
  ]
}
